   "text": "1 easy  repo Q&A bot (Read, Grep, Glob)\n2 med   PR reviewer (Bash git/gh + post_comment)\n3 med   docs writer (+ docs-writer sub-agent)\n4 hard  bug fixer: test -> fix -> re-test (+hooks)\n* Stack: run ./build-apk.sh + adb tests, explain",
