   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792511904971,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1 easy  FAQ bot (one agent + file search)\n2 med   support desk: triage -> billing/tech/refund\n3 med   meeting notes -> summary + tasks (zod)\n4 hard  voice receptionist + calendar + approval\n* Stack: help agent -> 'bug-triage' agent",
