   "text": "1 easy  ReAct bot + memory (checkpointer)\n2 med   careful RAG: grade docs, rewrite Q\n3 med   approval flow: draft -> interrupt -> OK\n4 hard  supervisor team, resumes after crash\n* Mitra AI: voice order -> confirm -> alert",
