   "text": "my-product/\n├─ frontend/ (Next.js)\n│  ├─ app/api/agent/route.ts\n│  │    # proxy -> backend (+token)\n│  └─ middleware.ts  # Clerk\n├─ backend/ (FastAPI, uv)\n│  ├─ routers/agent.py\n│  │    # POST /agent/stream (SSE)\n│  ├─ agent/graph.py state.py\n│  │     nodes.py tools.py\n│  ├─ services/  db/  schemas.py\n│  └─ tests/     # pytest + evals\n└─ docker-compose.yml",
   "originalText": "my-product/\n├─ frontend/ (Next.js)\n│  ├─ app/api/agent/route.ts\n│  │    # proxy -> backend (+token)\n│  └─ middleware.ts  # Clerk\n├─ backend/ (FastAPI, uv)\n│  ├─ routers/agent.py\n│  │    # POST /agent/stream (SSE)\n│  ├─ agent/graph.py state.py\n│  │     nodes.py tools.py\n│  ├─ services/  db/  schemas.py\n│  └─ tests/     # pytest + evals\n└─ docker-compose.yml",
