   "text": "why api/: static app has no server, and a\nkey inside an APK can be stolen.",
   "originalText": "why api/: static app has no server, and a\nkey inside an APK can be stolen.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "n03066346",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 3600,
   "width": 800.32,
   "height": 135.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a00306",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 278331463,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1701105973,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792511904971,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "rules for EVERY combined app\n1. model API keys only on the server (.env) - never in browser / phone.\n2. agent code in its own folder -> easy to test + switch the model.\n3. app passes the logged-in user id to tools; the model never picks whose data.\n4. stream answers (SSE); long jobs -> worker / queue.\n5. shared types (zod / Pydantic) in one place.",
   "originalText": "rules for EVERY combined app\n1. model API keys only on the server (.env) - never in browser / phone.\n2. agent code in its own folder -> easy to test + switch the model.\n3. app passes the logged-in user id to tools; the model never picks whose data.\n4. stream answers (SSE); long jobs -> worker / queue.\n5. shared types (zod / Pydantic) in one place.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
